en:
"It's not that you have to,
but if you were to explain the Divine Realm,
people would begin to question what you are, Toner, to know such things."{w}

"Well, look at the vessel I'm in. I'm bound to be affected by it.
And you know, she's so warm and big!
The way she wraps you up, it's like..."{w}

"What should I do, huh?"{w}{p}"I don't mind either way.
It's just, the people who are still praying to Rogera...
they're kind of... you know."{w}{p}"Same goes for Dehain's followers, too."{w}

"It is common in every land."{w}{p}"Prayer and faith are what the heart leans on.
If they bring peace of mind,
the truth has no value."{w}

"Yeah, that!
Fulfaray made such a racket about it!"{w}{p}"Fulfaray kept going on and on, so I just got all excited right back.
And then off they ran, ranting and raving! Ahaha!"{w}

"I can go along with your story
as much as you like."{w}{p}"However, everything, this conversation included,
is surely being recorded by the System."{w}

"You know, I think Void's going to fail.
Even this sending-to-the-Horizon business
is actually insurance for when the Phase Shift happens..."{w}

"...Sorry."{w}{p}"But still, I don't want to just sit on the sidelines
and watch!
Apasha too -- I'll make them cough up that soul, no matter what!"{w}

"How lovely, you came again.
You're welcome to come every day, you know?
I'll take good care of you."{w}

"I heard there was some vampire woman
putting on airs as a 'Soul Therapist'.
That's you, right?"{w}

"I was asked by Rogera, the former god of Dark Oblivion,
to save the souls caught in the in-between."{w}{p}"I can't forgive those who defile the remains
of the dead, the way you do."{w}

"Dooon't... diiis... turrrb...
ourrr... sleeeeep...
aaaaaah!"{w}

The "big brother" who appeared before you
was quite clearly a monster
known as an Arob.{w}

"Please, adventurers...
please help Big Brother...
Please..."{w}

"Big Brother says eating Bona's cookies
will make him feel all better."{w}{p}"You should eat some with us too, adventurers!
They're so yummy! Bona's cookies!"{w}

"I'm sorry, adventurers.
This all happened because of Bona..."{w}{p}"You're in the middle of your journey, and you saved
not just Bona, but Big Brother too..."{w}

"Bona's going to be good from now on.
I'll listen to what Big Brother says, and become
a good monster just like him!"{w}

"Bona's not very good at it, but
I'll pray lots and lots for you, adventurers."{w}{p}"May the forest and the Sun Spirit protect you, adventurers!
Come play again, okay!"{w}

"Hi, adventurers!
Bona and Big Brother are both doing great!"{w}{p}"And so is that chatty sapling, of course."{w}{p}"Don't you worry, adventurers.
Bona's gonna take good care of it."{w}

"Hey, hey. What the heck are you buryin' me in?
Don't go buryin' some mystery junk!"{w}{p}"Even comin' from you, Bona,
gimme a break here."{w}

"This thing's sooo big, after all.
Maybe it bumped right into the sky!
But what could be up there...?"{w}

"Ohh! Adventurers, well done saving the Palace of the Sun!"{w}{p}"When I heard you adventurers were coming to this village,
I came all the way from Teridon to deliver love!"{w}{p}"Now, accept it!
This! Is the finest! LOVE!!"{w}

"You're right, Big Brother. Let's start the party!"{w}{p}"Bona could only make cookies,
but there are tons of them to make up for it!"{w}{p}"Come eat and dance with us, adventurers!
It'll be so much fun!"{w}

Before you were the dying Anib and a monster
that must have been the owner of that stone.{w}{p}As you rushed over, Anib murmured something faintly
and passed out.{w}

{0E}*                         DANGER AHEAD                         *
*                      HAUNTED MANSION                       *
*                            KEEP AWAY                             *{0F}

"If ya wanna go any further,
ya gotta collect three medals."{w}{p}"The medals are scattered
all over this floor!{w}Let's go find 'em -- the Joker Land Medals!"{w}
